  sentences:
  - Princess is not the worse thing I've been called. I'll take it.
  - You want to marry the dragon?
  - Think of all the adventures I'll live with a dragon. I'm sure I'll get a balad
    or two out of it. Fame! Fortune! What else would I dream of?
  - I'll bring you the greatest treasure my Princess!
  - I'm counting on it darling!
  - ...
  - '*Hum* What about the tournament? '
  - I shall win it and bring glory to my future spouse!
  - Does that mean you still get the "real" Princess' hand in marriage?
  - '!'
  - Dragons don't share, my Princess. You are mine and mine only.
  - ...
  - What, I'm just asking.
  - My Princess is eager to be bedded. Let the tournament begin so I shall take him
    to my den promptly.
  - Oh my!
  - I don't want to know. I declare this tournament open, may the best prevail!
